# Saved copies of other people's sites. A SingleFile save of another company's
# site was once committed to the mertozcetin.com repo while studying its layout,
# and had to be rewritten out of history before that repo could go public — git
# serves every prior commit forever, so a public repo would have hosted someone
# else's entire website under Mert's name, indefinitely. Never again.
*.singlefile.html
